MACRO 1 START
* The customer record layout, shared by every program that reads it.
* &START is where the record begins; the rest follow it with * (the next
* available byte), so one parameter positions the whole layout.
  CU-NUMBER   &START     9 N
  CU-NAME     *         30 A
  CU-STATE    *          2 A
  CU-BALANCE  *          5 P 2
